Subject: [PATCH 3/4] feat(phase-9b): the app runs as clinova_app, which can't
 rewrite or erase the audit log

0005's REVOKE didn't bind the app, because the app connected as the table
owner. Now:
- Migration 0009 (hand-written, idempotent, a no-op where the role doesn't
  exist): clinova_app gets DML on every table, only SELECT/INSERT on
  audit_log, and default privileges for future tables.
