  and falls back to DATABASE_URL until it is set. Migrations and scripts
  keep the owner via DATABASE_URL_UNPOOLED.
- Integration test (TEST_APP_DATABASE_URL): as clinova_app, INSERT works;
  UPDATE, DELETE, TRUNCATE, DROP fail with 42501 and it can't grant itself
  the rights back; other app writes still work.
- The browser tests run the app as the restricted role when configured.

Verified on the Neon test branch (role created via Neon, migration applied,
tamper attempts refused, a full booking transaction works) and locally:
228 unit tests, integration 15/15, browser suite 10/10 as clinova_app.

